  ---
  Stock Queries disabled
    SPARQL
      All notes with tags → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?title ?tag WHERE {\\n  ?note rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?note dc:title ?title .\\n  ?note minerva:hasTag ?tagNode .\\n  ?tagNode minerva:tagName ?tag .\\n}\\nORDER BY ?title ?tag","language":"sparql"}]
      Backlinks to note → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\n# Edit the target note path below\\nSELECT DISTINCT ?title ?path WHERE {\\n  ?source rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?source dc:title ?title .\\n  ?source minerva:relativePath ?path .\\n  ?source ?linkPred ?target .\\n  ?linkPred rdfs:subPropertyOf* minerva:linksTo .\\n  ?target minerva:relativePath \\"YOUR_NOTE.md\\" .\\n}\\nORDER BY ?title","language":"sparql"}]
      Orphan notes → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?title ?path WHERE {\\n  ?note rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?note dc:title ?title .\\n  ?note minerva:relativePath ?path .\\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?note ?outPred ?any . ?outPred rdfs:subPropertyOf* minerva:linksTo . }\\n  FILTER NOT EXISTS { ?other ?inPred ?note . ?inPred rdfs:subPropertyOf* minerva:linksTo . }\\n}\\nORDER BY ?title","language":"sparql"}]
      Most-linked notes → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?title ?path (COUNT(DISTINCT ?source) AS ?incomingLinks) WHERE {\\n  ?note rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?note dc:title ?title .\\n  ?note minerva:relativePath ?path .\\n  ?source ?linkPred ?note .\\n  ?linkPred rdfs:subPropertyOf* minerva:linksTo .\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?note ?title ?path\\nORDER BY DESC(?incomingLinks)","language":"sparql"}]
      Recently modified → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?title ?path ?modified WHERE {\\n  ?note rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?note dc:title ?title .\\n  ?note minerva:relativePath ?path .\\n  ?note dc:modified ?modified .\\n}\\nORDER BY DESC(?modified)","language":"sparql"}]
      All tags with counts → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?tag (COUNT(?note) AS ?count) WHERE {\\n  ?tagNode rdf:type minerva:Tag .\\n  ?tagNode minerva:tagName ?tag .\\n  ?note minerva:hasTag ?tagNode .\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?tagNode ?tag\\nORDER BY DESC(?count)","language":"sparql"}]
      Notes in folder → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\n# Edit the folder path below\\nSELECT ?title ?path WHERE {\\n  ?note rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?note dc:title ?title .\\n  ?note minerva:relativePath ?path .\\n  ?note minerva:inFolder ?folder .\\n  ?folder minerva:relativePath \\"YOUR_FOLDER\\" .\\n}\\nORDER BY ?title","language":"sparql"}]
      Typed outgoing links → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?sourceTitle ?linkType ?targetTitle WHERE {\\n  ?source rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?source dc:title ?sourceTitle .\\n  ?source ?predicate ?target .\\n  ?target rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?target dc:title ?targetTitle .\\n  ?predicate rdfs:subPropertyOf minerva:linksTo .\\n  BIND(REPLACE(STR(?predicate), \\"https://minerva.dev/ontology#\\", \\"\\") AS ?linkType)\\n}\\nORDER BY ?sourceTitle ?linkType","language":"sparql"}]
      Typed backlinks → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?targetTitle ?linkType ?sourceTitle WHERE {\\n  ?source rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?source dc:title ?sourceTitle .\\n  ?source ?predicate ?target .\\n  ?target rdf:type minerva:Note .\\n  ?target dc:title ?targetTitle .\\n  ?predicate rdfs:subPropertyOf minerva:linksTo .\\n  BIND(REPLACE(STR(?predicate), \\"https://minerva.dev/ontology#\\", \\"\\") AS ?linkType)\\n}\\nORDER BY ?targetTitle ?linkType","language":"sparql"}]
      All sources with authors and year → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?sourceId ?title ?creator ?year WHERE {\\n  ?src minerva:sourceId ?sourceId .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:title ?title }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:creator ?creator }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:issued ?issued . BIND(SUBSTR(STR(?issued), 1, 4) AS ?year) }\\n}\\nORDER BY ?sourceId","language":"sparql"}]
      Most-cited sources → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?sourceId ?title (COUNT(DISTINCT ?note) AS ?citations) WHERE {\\n  ?src minerva:sourceId ?sourceId .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:title ?title }\\n  {\\n    ?note thought:cites ?src .\\n  } UNION {\\n    ?note thought:quotes ?excerpt .\\n    ?excerpt thought:fromSource ?src .\\n  }\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?src ?sourceId ?title\\nORDER BY DESC(?citations)","language":"sparql"}]
      Sources cited by N or more notes → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\n# Edit MIN_COUNT to change the threshold.\\nSELECT ?sourceId ?title (COUNT(DISTINCT ?note) AS ?citations) WHERE {\\n  ?src minerva:sourceId ?sourceId .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:title ?title }\\n  {\\n    ?note thought:cites ?src .\\n  } UNION {\\n    ?note thought:quotes ?excerpt .\\n    ?excerpt thought:fromSource ?src .\\n  }\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?src ?sourceId ?title\\nHAVING (COUNT(DISTINCT ?note) >= 2)\\nORDER BY DESC(?citations)","language":"sparql"}]
      Most-quoted sources → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?sourceId ?title (COUNT(?excerpt) AS ?excerptCount) WHERE {\\n  ?src minerva:sourceId ?sourceId .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:title ?title }\\n  ?excerpt thought:fromSource ?src .\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?src ?sourceId ?title\\nORDER BY DESC(?excerptCount)","language":"sparql"}]
      Sources missing metadata → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?sourceId ?title ?creator WHERE {\\n  ?src minerva:sourceId ?sourceId .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:title ?title }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?src dc:creator ?creator }\\n  FILTER(!BOUND(?title) || !BOUND(?creator))\\n}\\nORDER BY ?sourceId","language":"sparql"}]
      Pending proposals → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?proposal ?note ?operationType ?proposedBy ?proposedAt WHERE {\\n  ?proposal rdf:type thought:Proposal .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposalStatus thought:pending .\\n  ?proposal thought:operationType ?operationType .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedBy ?proposedBy .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedAt ?proposedAt .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:proposalNote ?note }\\n}\\nORDER BY ?proposedAt","language":"sparql"}]
      Contributions by agent → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?proposedBy ?status (COUNT(?proposal) AS ?count) WHERE {\\n  ?proposal rdf:type thought:Proposal .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedBy ?proposedBy .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposalStatus ?status .\\n}\\nGROUP BY ?proposedBy ?status\\nORDER BY ?proposedBy ?status","language":"sparql"}]
      Provenance history for note → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\n# Edit the target note path below.\\nSELECT ?operationType ?note ?status ?proposedBy ?proposedAt ?statusChangedAt ?conversation WHERE {\\n  ?target minerva:relativePath \\"YOUR_NOTE.md\\" .\\n  ?proposal rdf:type thought:Proposal .\\n  ?proposal thought:affectsNode ?target .\\n  ?proposal thought:operationType ?operationType .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedBy ?proposedBy .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedAt ?proposedAt .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposalStatus ?statusNode .\\n  BIND(REPLACE(STR(?statusNode), \\"https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#\\", \\"\\") AS ?status)\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:proposalNote ?note }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:statusChangedAt ?statusChangedAt }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:conversationRef ?conversation }\\n}\\nORDER BY ?proposedAt","language":"sparql"}]
      Recently decided proposals → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?operationType ?note ?affectsPath ?status ?proposedBy ?statusChangedAt WHERE {\\n  ?proposal rdf:type thought:Proposal .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposalStatus ?statusNode .\\n  FILTER(?statusNode != thought:pending)\\n  BIND(REPLACE(STR(?statusNode), \\"https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#\\", \\"\\") AS ?status)\\n  ?proposal thought:operationType ?operationType .\\n  ?proposal thought:proposedBy ?proposedBy .\\n  ?proposal thought:statusChangedAt ?statusChangedAt .\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:proposalNote ?note }\\n  OPTIONAL { ?proposal thought:affectsNode ?affects . ?affects minerva:relativePath ?affectsPath }\\n}\\nORDER BY DESC(?statusChangedAt)","language":"sparql"}]
      Conversation history → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"PREFIX minerva: <https://minerva.dev/ontology#>\\nPREFIX dc: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>\\nPREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>\\nPREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>\\nPREFIX thought: <https://minerva.dev/ontology/thought#>\\n\\nSELECT ?conversation ?status ?startedAt ?triggerTitle WHERE {\\n  ?conversation rdf:type thought:Conversation .\\n  ?conversation thought:conversationStatus ?statusNode .\\n  ?statusNode rdfs:label ?status .\\n  ?conversation thought:startedAt ?startedAt .\\n  OPTIONAL {\\n    ?conversation thought:trigger ?trigger .\\n    ?trigger dc:title ?triggerTitle .\\n  }\\n}\\nORDER BY DESC(?startedAt)","language":"sparql"}]
    SQL
      All tables → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"SELECT table_name\\nFROM information_schema.tables\\nWHERE table_schema = 'main'\\nORDER BY table_name;","language":"sql"}]
      Describe schema → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"-- Replace YOUR_TABLE with a name from the Tables panel.\\nDESCRIBE YOUR_TABLE;","language":"sql"}]
      Summarize (per-column stats) → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"-- Replace YOUR_TABLE with a name from the Tables panel.\\nSUMMARIZE YOUR_TABLE;","language":"sql"}]
      Null rate per column → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"-- Replace YOUR_TABLE with a name from the Tables panel.\\nSELECT column_name, null_percentage\\nFROM (SUMMARIZE YOUR_TABLE)\\nORDER BY null_percentage DESC;","language":"sql"}]
      Top values for a column → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"-- Replace YOUR_TABLE and YOUR_COLUMN.\\nSELECT YOUR_COLUMN, COUNT(*) AS n\\nFROM YOUR_TABLE\\nGROUP BY YOUR_COLUMN\\nORDER BY n DESC\\nLIMIT 20;","language":"sql"}]
      Rows per month → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"-- Replace YOUR_TABLE and YOUR_DATE_COLUMN.\\nSELECT\\n  date_trunc('month', YOUR_DATE_COLUMN) AS month,\\n  COUNT(*) AS rows\\nFROM YOUR_TABLE\\nGROUP BY month\\nORDER BY month;","language":"sql"}]
  Saved Queries disabled
    (role undefined)
      Open questions → send menu:openStockQuery [{"query":"SELECT 1","language":"sparql"}]
    ---
    Edit Saved Queries… → send menu:command ["query.editSaved"]
  ---
  Export Knowledge Graph… disabled → (no effect)
Export
  PDF… disabled → send menu:export ["pdf"]
  ---
  Static Site… disabled → send menu:export ["site"]
  ---
  Publish to Web… disabled → send menu:command ["export.publish"]
Window
  (role minimize)
  (role zoom)
  ---
  (role front)
  ---
Help role=help
  Install Tutorial Thoughtbase… → send menu:command ["app.installTutorial"]
  ---
  Keyboard Shortcuts… [CmdOrCtrl+/] → send menu:command ["app.shortcuts"]
  ---
  Documentation → openExternal https://dgriffith.github.io/minerva/docs/
  Report an Issue… → openExternal https://github.com/dgriffith/ide-for-thought/issues/new/choose
  ---
  Install ‘minerva’ Command in PATH… → installMinervaCommand"
`;
